# Files Wrangler must NOT upload as Worker static assets.
# The Cloudflare build clones the repo, and `wrangler deploy` reads assets
# from the repo root ("."), so without this it tries to upload the repo's
# own .git directory. The .git/objects packfile exceeds the 25 MiB per-asset
# limit and fails the whole deploy. Exclude .git and other non-served cruft.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
node_modules
.DS_Store
*.md
wrangler.jsonc
functions
.wrangler
